  "lineage_note": "European Super Cup: European Cup/Champions League winners v Cup Winners' Cup winners (1973-1999), then v UEFA Cup/Europa League winners (2000 on). Season label = the year it was played (1973's edition was played in January 1974). First official edition 1973; the 1972 Ajax v Rangers matches were unofficial (UEFA refused to sanction them) and are not included. Two-legged until 1997 (single match in 1984, 1986, 1991 by agreement); single match from 1998. Not held 1974, 1981, 1985. top_scorer and top_assister do not apply to a one-match final and are null. player_of_season holds UEFA's official man of the match, given without a break from 2010 (2009 had no award per UEFA's press kit).",
